From: d4r
Subject: [PATCH] Real DLSS-Denoiser PTX and AMDGPU compiler fixes

Apply after 0002-0007, with the LLVM submodule initialized. Adds the denoiser
surface stores, floating-coordinate half texture sampling, finite-saturating
half conversion, typed half exponentiation, wide-register byte stores,
half unordered comparison and atomic reduction. CUDA block barriers release
writes before the hardware barrier and acquire visibility after it.
Fixes strict division operand selection in AMDGPU and quadratic instruction-order
rebuilding in CodeGenPrepare operand sinking. Scalar sinking checks for a viable
target before scanning memory dependencies, retaining write tracking for reads.
Device helper bitcode must be regenerated before building ZLUDA.

